gin":"YangQwQ","id":68430140,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NDMwMTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68430140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ","html_url":"https://github.com/YangQwQ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T12:34:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T12:34:34Z","body":"> Can you reproduce this in previous versions?\n\nYes, I just tested with Godot 3.5 stable and can confirm the same behavior","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083488269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083543531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121792#issuecomment-5083543531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121792","id":5083543531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLwC36w","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T12:50:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T12:50:06Z","body":"Can confirm issue, looking at `grid_container.cpp` it never calls `get_stretch_ratio()` whichis a hard requirement for respecting the strech ratio. I would also agree with labeling it as a bug. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5083543531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5106886469","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121792#issuecomment-5106886469","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121792","id":5106886469,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMGTnRQ","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T16:27:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T16:31:46Z","body":"I've been thinking about it, and I think this might not be a bug, but intended behavior. Due to each row and column containing multiple elements, each with a unique stretch ratio, there is no way to respect all of them. Some decision would have to be made on which to respect, which sounds like a terrible idea if I can be honest.\nI think the better approach for this current situation is a doc update to make it abundantly clear that `GridContainer` doesn't respect stretch ratios.\nWe could theoretically add \"policies\" to `GridContainer` for both rows and columns, something like use biggest/smallest/average stretch ratio, but that'll get messy and is not a good idea in my opinion. Furthermore, stretch ratio is one number, but grids have two dimensions, so it would be impossible to control the two axises separately for any given element.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5106886469/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5110515803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121792#issuecomment-5110515803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121792","id":5110515803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMJxIWw","user":{"login":"YangQwQ","id":68430140,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NDMwMTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68430140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ","html_url":"https://github.com/YangQwQ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YangQwQ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T22:51:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T22:51:38Z","body":"Ah, got it. That makes sense, Thanks for the explanation!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5110515803/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]